      "content": "Hey, I need you to run a full optimization audit on the DC-4 cluster. We're seeing way too much overhead on the energy bill this month. Look at all the active modules and give me a plan to hit a 15% reduction in energy usage while keeping latency under 5ms. Just be aggressive with it—find anything that's eating up too many resources.",
