      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'll get you those metrics shortly. For now, just give me a preliminary assessment based on the architecture you currently manage. Specifically, identify which modules or services are the biggest \"power hogs\" and whether they're actually necessary for the 5ms latency requirement. If something is taking up huge compute but isn't mission-critical, suggest cutting it.",
